      "content": "ok yes this is perfect lol\n\npoet... I want to ask you something. what do you think about people who just feel like they've run out of reasons? like they wake up every day and there's just... nothing there anymore. emptiness. like the candle just went out and no one noticed\n\nwhat does your philosophy say about that",
